flowchart TD
  P0["📱 [project] or [bug] issue"]:::human -.-> Q0["AI splits into queued [idea] issues<br/>(built, not verified)"]:::planned
  Q0 -.-> A
  A["📱 You: new [idea] issue<br/>(GitHub mobile)"]:::human --> B["Interviewer (Claude)<br/>asks questions"]
  B -->|STATUS: QUESTIONS| C["📱 You answer in comments"]:::human
  C --> B
  B -->|STATUS: READY<br/>brief posted| D["📱 You: comment /go review"]:::human
  D --> E["GitHub Actions starts run<br/>new branch pipeline/timestamp"]
  E --> F["Researcher (Claude)"]
  F --> G["Planner (Claude)<br/>writes spec.md"]
  G -->|STATUS: BLOCKED| H["Run stops, questions posted<br/>📱 you answer, re-run"]:::human
  G -->|READY, NEEDS_DESIGN: yes| I["Designer (Claude)"]
  G -->|READY, NEEDS_DESIGN: no| J
  I --> J["Devin builds on the branch<br/>(cloud, no PR)"]
  J -->|pushed no commits| K["Run stops<br/>check Devin session"]:::stop
  J --> L["Install deps<br/>npm / pip"]
  L --> M["Tester (Claude)<br/>runs tests and build"]
  M -->|RESULT: FAIL<br/>retry up to 2| J
  M -->|RESULT: PASS| N["Reviewer (Claude, read-only)"]
  N -->|NEEDS WORK<br/>retry up to 2| J
  N -->|SHIP / NEEDS WORK / BLOCK| O["Draft PR opened by orchestrator<br/>CI started on the branch"]
  O --> P["📱 You review diff and test results"]:::human
  P -->|looks good| Q["📱 You merge"]:::human
  P -->|changes wanted| R["/fix comment<br/>(built, not verified)"]:::planned
  R --> J
  Q --> S["Next queued idea offered<br/>/queue start or auto<br/>(built, not verified)"]:::planned
  S --> E
  classDef human fill:#fde68a,stroke:#b45309,color:#111
  classDef stop fill:#fecaca,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#111
  classDef planned fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-dasharray:5 3,color:#111
